<title>USA: NOPA revises Dec U.S. soybean crushings.</title>
<headline>NOPA revises Dec U.S. soybean crushings.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Oilseed Processors Association on Friday revised its December soybean oil production to 1,454.97 million pounds from its January 15 estimate of 1,478.32 million pounds. It also revised its December yield to 10.73 pounds per bushel from 10.91 pounds per bushel. The revised report follows:  </p>
<p>  CRUSHINGS (1,000 bu) -- DEC96     NOV96    DEC 95</p>
<p> -		Illinois   23,915    22,765    22,535</p>
<p> -   Indiana, Ky, Ohio   22,827    21,591    19,452</p>
<p> -	    South East   22,525    22,529    22,159</p>
<p> -	 South Central   14,182    13,437    11,351</p>
<p> -	    South West   18,876    17,983    16,688</p>
<p> -		    Iowa   24,303    22,850    22,916</p>
<p> - Minn, N/SDak., Mont    8,923     9,687     8,811</p>
<p> -	    Total U.S.  135,551   130,843   123,912</p>
